passage:
@StageWatch
I was near the front at Lani's show last night. In the first song, she looked down at her feet and stopped singing. Everyone went quiet. One shoe was higher than the other!

She took both shoes off and started again. By the last song, half the people near me had their shoes off too. Now everyone is posting photos of their feet. Nobody in my group is talking about the new songs. #LaniLive

@WeekendRunner
I ran on Green Road at seven this morning. It was closed to cars for the street party. Workers were still putting tables out, so the long road was empty.

By ten, there were food stalls, music and hundreds of people. I could hardly walk between them. The party looked great in my friends' photos. My favourite part happened before anyone took a photo. I want that empty road one morning each month. #GreenRoad

@MarketMorning
I got home with noodles in my bag today. I usually take my little car to the market. I walk past all the nearby shops because I can buy the same things there after work.

Today, I took one bag and went by bus. The bus stop is at the other end. I walked past a bread stall and a woman selling fresh noodles. My bag filled before I reached my usual shops. Same market, different breakfast. #SaturdayShopping
